Branson Pluckwort is a member of the [[Org/Velvet Mark/index|Velvet Mark]], a lizardfolk with dragon blood six foot five tall, whose scales and bearing suggest a hell dragon. He wears red metal armor engraved with bone and marked as a hell knight's, and he carries a fortress shield, a two-handed scythe, and a smaller scythe at his side. He has draconic wings and a tail, smokes a large cigar, and keeps a notebook in which he writes down everyone he meets and who he could take in a fight. He is a cleric and a would-be underground surgeon.

He is new to this part of the world, having come from the [[Phenomena/Infinite Horizon|Infinite Horizon]], and he practices a martial art of his own invention he calls Dragon Shield Fury Drag Shifu.
